    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>The Venom Shotgun is a Cerberus-developed weapon that fires charged explosive rounds rather than conventional scatter shot. The rounds detonate on impact in a concussive blast that knocks enemies off their feet regardless of their armor rating. Users who miss a direct hit still benefit from the blast radius. With only five rounds before requiring a heat sink swap, each shot must count - but the Venom rewards the patience to make them do exactly that.</p>"
